			],
			"Message": "docs(Echo): Normalize badge and callout icon spacing\n\nAlign Markdown formatting in README.md to ensure consistent whitespace around icons and links. Replace emoji characters with HTML entities prefixed with zero-width space (`&#x2001;`) in badge headers and the ecosystem diagram title to prevent irregular line wrapping and misalignment in GitHub's rendering.\n\nAdditionally, remove the conversational clapperboard icon (`📣`) from the Rust API Documentation link, standardizing the presentation to plain text followed by the book icon. Fix the spacing in the 'Interested in tackling one of these challenges?' callout to use the correct HTML entity for the pointing finger.",
			"SHA": "e94ff1df28336487f41d6d02d2e3af0e05155ce5"
